# The castle defend teleporter (CastleDefendTeleporter): Gludio Castle's first inner gatekeeper,
# talked to by a character in no clan, answers its refusal (onFirstTalk: no clan is on the owner
# or defender side), which carries no link: the "0" link of the defenders' page, sent anyway, is
# dropped before the script sees it. A scenario seeds no castle siege registration and no
# teleport destination check, so the defenders' page, the owner's, the drawn point of a link and
# the move are in tests/npcs/castle_defend_teleporter_test.go.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/castle_defend_teleporter_refused.golden
character Outsider 20
script script.teleport.CastleDefendTeleporter
page script/teleport/CastleDefendTeleporter/
npc gatekeeper 35092 Folk 10 0 0

action gatekeeper
action gatekeeper
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=gatekeeper item=0 page=script/teleport/CastleDefendTeleporter/first_group_1_no.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass Quest CastleDefendTeleporter 0
